<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NABI cut by Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NABI cut by Lehman.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Tony Butler downgraded NABI Inc to outperform from buy, cutting his 1998 earnings per share estimate on the company to $0.60 from $0.81.</p>
<p>-- Cited news the National Institutes of Health had decided to discontinue patient enrollment in its Phase III trial of NABI's HIV-IG drug.</p>
<p>-- The analyst said in a summary report he had discontinued HIV-IG completely from his earnings model for NABI.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/4 at 7-3/8.</p>
</text>
